{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "story_fuze_set_1_story_1",
  "groupId": "story_fuze_set_1",
  "stageId": null,
  "title": "夢醒時分",
  "storyCode": null,
  "avgTag": "幕間",
  "sourcePath": "../../vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_fuze_1_1.txt",
  "sourceHash": "7cf99fac292aadc71560cc659b98894e7c31dd999c1f2da98d619b62ec9bf201",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_ltroom"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "憔悴的貴族",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_493_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "憔悴的貴族",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_493_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "陌生人，報上你的名字。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_493_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……FUZE。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "憔悴的貴族",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_493_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "聽口音，是烏薩斯人？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FUZE",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_493_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "算是。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "憔悴的貴族",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_493_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "什麼事？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FUZE",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_493_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "鎮上的水塔壞了。我想修好它。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "憔悴的貴族",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_493_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你自己去修就好了，來找我做什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FUZE",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_493_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "水塔的問題出在水泵的源石電路上，我懂工程，你懂源石技藝，你幫得上忙。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "憔悴的貴族",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_493_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……一位全副武裝的蒙面烏薩斯人？來修這座萊塔尼亞鎮子上的水塔？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鎮民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_496_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "伯梅先生……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伯梅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_493_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哦，你也在啊。這個人到底怎麼回事？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鎮民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_496_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我和老維塞去河邊取水時被針蚤襲擊了，老維塞受了傷，是這位FUZE先生救了我們。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伯梅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_493_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "老維塞受傷了？傷得重嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鎮民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_496_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只能說……還活著。他孫女在照顧他。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伯梅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_493_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我知道了。你接著說。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鎮民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_496_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們款待FUZE先生時，他看見鎮上本來是有座水塔的，就想看看能不能修好，結果發現問題不在機械結構，而在源石電路上……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伯梅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_493_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我明白了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鎮民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_496_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那、那我先走了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伯梅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_493_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以你問那個人鎮上有誰懂源石技藝，他就把你帶到我這裡來了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FUZE",
      "speakerId": "avg_4126_fuze_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（點頭）我希望你能幫幫你的領民。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伯梅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_493_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我不是他的領主。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FUZE",
      "speakerId": "avg_4126_fuze_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他說“男爵老爺”在許多年前修建了這座水塔。當我問他“男爵老爺”住在哪裡的時候，他把我往你這裡領。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伯梅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_493_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你也聽見了，他剛剛可沒叫我男爵老爺，他叫我伯梅先生。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FUZE",
      "speakerId": "avg_4126_fuze_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……那麼，伯梅先生，這是一座能讓人的生活好過些的設施。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伯梅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_493_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "以前人們一直都是步行到河畔取水的。那時沒人覺得有什麼不好過。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伯梅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_493_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "誰知道是不是因為水塔不斷抽取地下水，河畔才出現了能讓針蚤築巢的空洞呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FUZE",
      "speakerId": "avg_4126_fuze_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我只知道水塔要是早點修好，老維塞現在就不會命懸一線。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伯梅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_493_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不過是一死而已。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FUZE",
      "speakerId": "avg_4126_fuze_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你覺得他的死無關緊要？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伯梅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_493_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "何止是他。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伯梅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_493_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他、我、這座鎮子，甚至整個萊塔尼亞……一切都在不可逆地走向衰頹，最終死亡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伯梅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_493_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "死於針蚤和死於衰老，在我看來不過是騎馱獸還是走路到達終點的問題。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FUZE",
      "speakerId": "avg_4126_fuze_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……歪理。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伯梅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_493_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你去哪裡？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FUZE",
      "speakerId": "avg_4126_fuze_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "找其他人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伯梅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_493_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "鎮上沒有其他懂源石電路的人了，剛才帶你來的人肯定告訴過你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FUZE",
      "speakerId": "avg_4126_fuze_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那就找書。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伯梅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_493_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你為什麼這麼執拗？這些跟你萍水相逢的人值得你這麼堅持？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FUZE",
      "speakerId": "avg_4126_fuze_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "事比人重要。再見。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伯梅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_493_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "等等。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伯梅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_493_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果你需要這方面的書，我年輕的時候買過幾本。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FUZE",
      "speakerId": "avg_4126_fuze_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你找了好久。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伯梅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_493_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "找書也是很費工夫的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伯梅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_493_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "維多利亞出版的《源石電路理論與應用》，拿著吧。要從我家翻出一本不用萊塔尼亞語寫成的書也不容易。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伯梅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_493_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "現在你那張嚴嚴實實的面具後面一定寫滿了疑問，蒙面的烏薩斯人。你不知道我為什麼對修水塔推三阻四，卻肯借你書。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FUZE",
      "speakerId": "avg_4126_fuze_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我有一些假設。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伯梅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_493_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "比如？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FUZE",
      "speakerId": "avg_4126_fuze_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你想證明水塔修好也不會有什麼變化，證明自己是正確的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伯梅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_493_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒那麼複雜，我只是有點好奇。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FUZE",
      "speakerId": "avg_4126_fuze_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我以為像你這樣的人已經對一切都喪失興趣了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伯梅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_493_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "一個全副武裝的蒙面外國人無論如何都要幫你的鄰居們修水塔，我想就算是塊石頭也會好奇的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FUZE",
      "speakerId": "avg_4126_fuze_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "要嘛修好，要嘛修不好，僅此而已。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伯梅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_493_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不，我好奇的是……這個人究竟經歷過什麼，讓他對一件本來和他完全無關的事情如此執拗。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伯梅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_493_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不留下來住一晚嗎，FUZE先生？也許晚上我們可以聊聊天。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FUZE",
      "speakerId": "avg_4126_fuze_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "多謝你的好意，但我想我們不可能聊得來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伯梅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_493_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伯梅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_493_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你說得對。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伯梅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_493_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……可我還是想聊一聊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_black"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_493_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……舒瑞？怎麼了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FUZE",
      "speakerId": "avg_4126_fuze_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "抱歉，科茨，走神了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_corridor"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "FUZE環顧四周。\n是羅德島的走廊。談不上熟悉，但也不很陌生。\n他自己則兩手抱頭，靠在艾力亞斯·科茨在羅德島宿舍的門外，似乎正在等這位代號為BLITZ的同僚出門。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ？",
      "speakerId": "avg_4126_fuze_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "舒瑞，你還要再等一下子，羅德島的刮鬍刀不大好用。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FUZE",
      "speakerId": "avg_4126_fuze_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒關係。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ？",
      "speakerId": "avg_4126_fuze_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們剛剛聊到哪裡了？哦，對，我在萊塔尼亞看到的慶典。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ？",
      "speakerId": "avg_4126_fuze_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那場慶典的現場共有一千名術師。慶典開始前，術師們像雕塑一樣林立在城市廣場上，寂靜無聲。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ？",
      "speakerId": "avg_4126_fuze_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他們在等待著，等待一枚幾乎細不可聞的音符從樂團首席的指間飄落，那時術師們才會齊齊舉起手中的施術單元……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ？",
      "speakerId": "avg_4126_fuze_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "拜託，老兄，給點反應？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FUZE",
      "speakerId": "avg_4126_fuze_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我很難想像那個場景。萊塔尼亞和我熟悉的地方差異太大。想想看，一千個披袍子、戴面具、拿魔杖的人站在雷吉斯坦廣場上……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ？",
      "speakerId": "avg_4126_fuze_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "雷吉斯坦廣場？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FUZE",
      "speakerId": "avg_4126_fuze_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "撒馬爾罕的標誌性建築，你應該知道的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ？",
      "speakerId": "avg_4126_fuze_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好吧，那我接著講。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ？",
      "speakerId": "avg_4126_fuze_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "一千束法術的光芒衝向夜空，絢麗的色彩在雲層間碰撞、迸射，而後綻放，把目之所及的天空都繪成繽紛的花海……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FUZE",
      "speakerId": "avg_4126_fuze_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "塑能轉換系源石技藝的應用？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ？",
      "speakerId": "avg_4126_fuze_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你這不是很懂源石技藝嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FUZE",
      "speakerId": "avg_4126_fuze_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在多索雷斯突擊補課的成果。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FUZE",
      "speakerId": "avg_4126_fuze_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "煤、石油、天然氣，甚至核聚變……一切都被源石替代了，我只好加緊從頭學起——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FUZE",
      "speakerId": "avg_4126_fuze_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "科茨，怎麼了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ？",
      "speakerId": "avg_4126_fuze_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "刮鬍刀出了點故障，稍等——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_snowconutryinside"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "FUZE從翻開的書上猛然抬起頭來。他發覺自己剛剛趴在桌子上睡著了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FUZE",
      "speakerId": "avg_4126_fuze_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嘖，睡得背痛，頭也有點暈。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FUZE",
      "speakerId": "avg_4126_fuze_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“左圖為本書作者在萊塔尼亞訪學時見證的慶典場景……”"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FUZE",
      "speakerId": "avg_4126_fuze_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怪不得會夢見別人跟我講這些東西。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FUZE",
      "speakerId": "avg_4126_fuze_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "有什麼掉到地上了……書籤？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FUZE",
      "speakerId": "avg_4126_fuze_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "得把這個和書一起還回去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_windows"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FUZE",
      "speakerId": "avg_4126_fuze_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "麻煩去那邊，幫我按下開關。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鎮民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_496_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒反應啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FUZE",
      "speakerId": "avg_4126_fuze_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "看來還得找伯梅借幾本書。能麻煩你幫我跑一趟嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鎮民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_496_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "真的抱歉，FUZE先生，伯梅先生他……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FUZE",
      "speakerId": "avg_4126_fuze_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怎麼，他暗地裡幹些見不得人的事？我第一次去他家的時候你好像也很緊張。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鎮民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_496_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不不不，不是，絕對不是！伯梅先生不是壞人，只是……唉，我說不好……只是大家沒事不太喜歡去他那邊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FUZE",
      "speakerId": "avg_4126_fuze_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……算了，我自己去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_ltroom"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伯梅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_493_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "讓我看看……《實用家庭電工手冊》？我覺得這本書可能太簡單了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FUZE",
      "speakerId": "avg_4126_fuze_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "簡單也未必就沒有幫助。就這本。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伯梅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_493_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "當然可以。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伯梅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_493_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不過我很好奇，為什麼烏薩斯會有精通機械，卻對源石電路一竅不通的人？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FUZE",
      "speakerId": "avg_4126_fuze_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這對目前的問題來說不重要。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伯梅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_493_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們就不能拋開那座水塔，聊聊各自的生活嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FUZE",
      "speakerId": "avg_4126_fuze_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒必要。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伯梅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_493_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果你不願意先開口，也可以從我開始……從那座水塔開始。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伯梅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_493_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我可以告訴你，水塔是男爵老爺理想的第一步，他一開始也想讓附近的人過得好些。他想把鎮子變成“模範鎮”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伯梅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_493_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "很可惜，除了讓領民喝上了自來水，他一事無成。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伯梅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_493_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "男爵老爺想在鎮裡開工廠，想找首都的大人物來投資，想把這裡辦成藝術家的採風地……結果要麼事與願違，要麼沒人注意。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伯梅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_493_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他最後一次的嘗試最大膽，也離成功最近——他要把整座鎮子搬上移動平台，維杜尼亞的一家工坊已經和他談妥，收了一大筆定金——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伯梅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_493_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "然後女皇陛下蒞臨了她們忠實的崔林特爾梅。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FUZE",
      "speakerId": "avg_4126_fuze_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你在說你自己的故事？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伯梅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_493_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……我父親的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伯梅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_493_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我那時還很年輕，在維杜尼亞的大學裡寫我的傳心感知系法術論文。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伯梅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_493_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "結果那段時間我見得最多的就是血。平民的，貴族的，憲兵的，選帝侯的，還有我導師的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伯梅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_493_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "等我僥倖帶著被燒焦的論文逃回家時，我父親的第一句話是問我怎麼樣，第二句話是問那家工坊怎麼樣……還能怎麼樣？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FUZE",
      "speakerId": "avg_4126_fuze_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "然後你的父親鬱鬱而終，而你沒能繼承他的爵位。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伯梅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_493_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不，我主動放棄了他的爵位，因為我發覺一切都沒有意義。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FUZE",
      "speakerId": "avg_4126_fuze_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……知道你和你父親最大的區別是什麼嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伯梅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_493_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我洗耳恭聽。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FUZE",
      "speakerId": "avg_4126_fuze_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他除了讓鎮上的人喝上了自來水以外一事無成，而你連自來水都沒能讓他們喝上。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FUZE",
      "speakerId": "avg_4126_fuze_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果我們聊些更實際的東西，明天你的鄰居們就又能喝上自來水了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伯梅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_493_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "然後你一直為之努力的目標完成了，你會離開，你一刻都不會停留，不是嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FUZE",
      "speakerId": "avg_4126_fuze_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "萊塔尼亞一定有很多跟我一樣固執的人，你可以去找他們。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伯梅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_493_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不，我最近才知道，你是絕無僅有的那一個。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FUZE",
      "speakerId": "avg_4126_fuze_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "絕無僅有？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伯梅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_493_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒什麼。祝你的研究順利，FUZE先生。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伯梅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_493_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "還有，如果你遇見了老維塞的孫女，記得告訴她早點把人送過來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FUZE",
      "speakerId": "avg_4126_fuze_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "把人送過來？什麼意思？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伯梅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_493_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "字面意思。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_lmstreet_2"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_4125_rdoc_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這裡不錯，就這裡了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FUZE",
      "speakerId": "avg_4126_fuze_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這裡可夠暗的，卡提布。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "DOC？",
      "speakerId": "avg_4125_rdoc_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "看來這次我們真的會有很長時間回不去那個一切不由源石，而是由石油驅動的地方了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FUZE",
      "speakerId": "avg_4126_fuze_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "原來你也會找個陰暗的角落犯思鄉病。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "DOC？",
      "speakerId": "avg_4125_rdoc_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "當然。你還記得我們到這裡來的那天嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FUZE",
      "speakerId": "avg_4126_fuze_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怎麼會忘，我們去探查磁山二號實驗室的原址，結果一頭栽到雷內爾的高爾夫球上面。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "DOC？",
      "speakerId": "avg_4125_rdoc_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "說到家，和我聊聊你的家鄉吧。我記得撒馬爾罕有……雷吉斯坦廣場？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FUZE",
      "speakerId": "avg_4126_fuze_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是啊，天空是藍色的，建築的穹頂也是藍色，我甚至能想起廣場上的人群，往來的汽車，還有那三座巨大建築上的花紋……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_snowconutryinside"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "FUZE從書上抬起頭。\n不知從何時開始，睡意開始不分時間地點地襲來。他常常在草圖畫到一半時倒頭睡去，醒後還不得不努力把殘留的夢境從腦海中趕走。\n那些夢境太清晰，太真實。\n甚至，非常偶爾的幾次，他不由得認真思考泰拉是否真的只是一場長過了頭的夢境，他是不是在磁山二號磕了腦袋。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FUZE",
      "speakerId": "avg_4126_fuze_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（打哈欠）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FUZE",
      "speakerId": "avg_4126_fuze_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不能現在睡，至少要先去水塔上，或是再找伯梅借本書驗證一下——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FUZE",
      "speakerId": "avg_4126_fuze_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "等等，他是不是讓我跟老維塞的孫女說什麼……把人送過去？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_ltroom"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伯梅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_493_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "多謝你及時把老維塞送過來，他還剩一口氣。他孫女呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FUZE",
      "speakerId": "avg_4126_fuze_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "累病了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FUZE",
      "speakerId": "avg_4126_fuze_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "伯梅，為什麼你讓鎮民把垂死的人送到自己這裡來？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FUZE",
      "speakerId": "avg_4126_fuze_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我剛剛問過其他人了，他們吞吞吐吐，但最終還是告訴我，你一直在這麼做。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伯梅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_493_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "讓我猜猜……你在懷疑我利用死者？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FUZE",
      "speakerId": "avg_4126_fuze_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "一點點懷疑，不多，如果你之前的言論都屬實的話。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伯梅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_493_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這又怎麼說？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FUZE",
      "speakerId": "avg_4126_fuze_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "很難想像一個滿口“衰頹”、“死亡”和“沒有意義”的人能做成什麼真正的惡事。他不會錯，因為他根本什麼都不做。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伯梅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_493_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……你成功冒犯到我了，FUZE先生。但我不介意。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FUZE",
      "speakerId": "avg_4126_fuze_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你還沒回答我的問題。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伯梅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_493_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那就好好看著。你會明白的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "又是一陣強烈的睡意襲來。FUZE不得不狠狠咬了下舌頭，免得自己又在此時睡過去。\n而伯梅只是看著老人渾濁的雙眼，將短杖的一頭輕輕放在老人額頭上。\n杖尖微微發光。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老維塞",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（含混的咕噥聲）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老維塞",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "勒文，真的是你，你……你回來了……你真的回來了……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老維塞",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不，不用道歉，什麼都別說，我們……回家……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老維塞",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "給你，這是後院的蘋果……你出門時想吃一個，可偏偏那年一顆果子也沒有結，這些年我一直留著……"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "然而FUZE分明看見，老人伸出的手上並沒有什麼蘋果，他面前站著的人也只有伯梅一個。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FUZE",
      "speakerId": "avg_4126_fuze_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "勒文是誰？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伯梅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_493_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "老維塞的獨子，十幾年前得了礦石病，自己主動離開了鎮子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FUZE",
      "speakerId": "avg_4126_fuze_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你究竟對老維塞做了什麼？你給他製造了幻覺？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伯梅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_493_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怎麼會，那根本不是我能觸及的領域。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伯梅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_493_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我只是在緩解別人的痛苦，讓人放鬆，讓人在不該做夢的時間和地點沉入夢境……做一場我無權干涉的白日夢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FUZE",
      "speakerId": "avg_4126_fuze_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這聽起來就像某種無形的麻醉劑，類似醫生在醫院裡給痛苦難耐的病人打一針，緩解他們的痛苦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伯梅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_493_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果這是你的理解，我也無權多說什麼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FUZE",
      "speakerId": "avg_4126_fuze_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "藥物濫用是會毀掉一個人的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伯梅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_493_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "讓垂死之人離開得安詳一些也算濫用？舒瑞——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FUZE",
      "speakerId": "avg_4126_fuze_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伯梅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_493_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "FUZE先生，這已經是我能為別人做的最有意義的事了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FUZE",
      "speakerId": "avg_4126_fuze_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可你想過嗎，假如你願意早點為那座水塔做點什麼，老維塞根本不會瀕臨死亡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FUZE",
      "speakerId": "avg_4126_fuze_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在你那無形的麻醉劑中沉淪最深的不是任何一位垂死之人，而是你自己啊，伯梅。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伯梅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_493_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈哈，我嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伯梅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_493_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "也許是因為我看過太多悲劇，而見得越多，我就越是覺得自己是對的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伯梅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_493_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "天災、陰謀、戰爭、源石，甚至小小的意外……人的意志和生命在這些東西面前同樣脆弱，一觸即潰。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伯梅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_493_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "更別提現在，我也是垂死之人了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "伯梅解開衣服，露出胸腹間斑駁的源石結晶。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伯梅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_493_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "從崔林特爾梅回家的路上，我就發現自己的肋側……多了一塊小小的、黑黑的石頭，維杜尼亞給我留下的臨別贈禮。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伯梅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_493_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "直到今天，它已經快把我整個吞掉，所以我決定犯下我這輩子唯一一次的罪行。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FUZE",
      "speakerId": "avg_4126_fuze_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "罪行？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伯梅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_493_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "對一個身心健康且不願配合的人來說，我的法術需要許多嚴苛的準備才能生效。很抱歉把它們用在你身上。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伯梅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_493_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "一開始我只是好奇，希望聽聽一個沉默寡言的行動者在睡夢中會說些什麼，於是在書和書籤上……動了一點小小的手腳。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伯梅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_493_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "然後，我就在你的夢話裡聽見了一些破天荒的事情，一片沒有源石的……藍色天空。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伯梅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_493_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我不奢望跟你一起去那個沒有源石的地方，甚至不奢望能跟你成為朋友，畢竟你討厭我這樣不切實際的人，不是嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FUZE",
      "speakerId": "avg_4126_fuze_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伯梅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_493_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以我只好用法術……讓你我共同完成這場最後的白日夢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伯梅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_493_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "抱歉讓你陪一個礦石病人到最後一刻，但他已經孤獨太久了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "FUZE還來不及做任何反應，伯梅已經將短杖指向了他。\n劇烈的睡意撲向FUZE的眼眶。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "不知在何處響起的微細樂聲低沉而綿密，如同海底的暗流，將海面上沉浮的意識緩緩拖入水中。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_caveentrance"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_4125_rdoc_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "醒醒，舒瑞，醒醒！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FUZE",
      "speakerId": "avg_4126_fuze_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "咳、咳……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_4125_rdoc_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊，你醒了。恭喜，你的臉頰逃過了一劫。拿好你的裝備，我們準備離開這裡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FUZE",
      "speakerId": "avg_4126_fuze_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們這是在哪裡？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ELA",
      "speakerId": "avg_4123_ela_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "磁山二號實驗室。震動已經過去，什麼都沒發生，除了你撞到了頭。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ELA",
      "speakerId": "avg_4123_ela_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "實驗室內部已經確認沒有異常，DOC他們已經先行撤離。就算震動和列維有關係，也只能等下次再探查了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FUZE",
      "speakerId": "avg_4126_fuze_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯……嗯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_labcorridor"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ELA",
      "speakerId": "avg_4123_ela_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "來想想假期的事情吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FUZE",
      "speakerId": "avg_4126_fuze_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "假期？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ELA",
      "speakerId": "avg_4123_ela_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你怎麼連這也忘了？難道剛剛那一下撞得真的很重？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ELA",
      "speakerId": "avg_4123_ela_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "幫我想想要去哪，給我挑個最美的地方，讓我好好在那裡待上一陣子，散散心。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ELA",
      "speakerId": "avg_4123_ela_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "撒馬爾罕怎麼樣？你說過雷吉斯坦廣場的，那裡有藍色的天空，藍色的建築，還有壁畫、人群、汽車……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ELA",
      "speakerId": "avg_4123_ela_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "然後我就在那裡，什麼也不想，一躺就是一整天。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FUZE",
      "speakerId": "avg_4126_fuze_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FUZE",
      "speakerId": "avg_4126_fuze_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但是……不，不對……我好像還有事情沒做……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ELA",
      "speakerId": "avg_4123_ela_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "什麼事情？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FUZE",
      "speakerId": "avg_4126_fuze_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我不知道，但是——但是源石……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ELA",
      "speakerId": "avg_4123_ela_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "源石？那是什麼？該不會是你剛剛撞到頭的時候做夢了吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FUZE",
      "speakerId": "avg_4126_fuze_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "ELA，你聽說過……源石這個詞嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ELA",
      "speakerId": "avg_4123_ela_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你不該指望別人聽說過你剛剛夢見的東西。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FUZE",
      "speakerId": "avg_4126_fuze_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "抱歉，只是這個詞的印象……太強烈。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ELA",
      "speakerId": "avg_4123_ela_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "別想了，沒什麼好想的，還是想想雷吉斯坦廣場吧。也許我們等等就可以過去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ELA？",
      "speakerId": "avg_4123_ela_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你們的術——我是說，科學家，最頂尖的那一批——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ELA",
      "speakerId": "avg_4123_ela_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不，沒什麼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ELA",
      "speakerId": "avg_4123_ela_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "想到自己能去你的家鄉，去一個很美的地方度過一段日子，我很開心。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ELA",
      "speakerId": "avg_4123_ela_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "一個沒有天災，沒有戰亂，沒有悲劇的地方。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FUZE",
      "speakerId": "avg_4126_fuze_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒有……悲劇的地方？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ELA？",
      "speakerId": "avg_4123_ela_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "等等，舒瑞，你怎麼了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FUZE",
      "speakerId": "avg_4126_fuze_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你記得奧勒岡嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ELA？",
      "speakerId": "avg_4123_ela_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "舒瑞……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FUZE",
      "speakerId": "avg_4126_fuze_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "回答我，你覺得奧勒岡怎麼樣？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ELA？",
      "speakerId": "avg_4123_ela_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "奧、奧勒岡？算是個藝術家的好去處，有不錯的博物館，也有樂團什麼的……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FUZE",
      "speakerId": "avg_4126_fuze_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那麼巴格達？黎巴嫩？莫斯科？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ELA？",
      "speakerId": "avg_4123_ela_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……舒瑞，你聽我說——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FUZE",
      "speakerId": "avg_4126_fuze_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你以為沒有源石——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ELA？",
      "speakerId": "avg_4123_ela_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不，不！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FUZE",
      "speakerId": "avg_4126_fuze_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "悲劇就再也不會發生了嗎，伯梅？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_ltroom"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伯梅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_493_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（慘笑）怎麼會呢，舒瑞。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伯梅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_493_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "也許一切都會以沒有源石的形式捲土重來，但你不該苛責一個垂死的礦石病患者把它們想得太好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FUZE",
      "speakerId": "avg_4126_fuze_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那你也許需要看看我剛剛說過的那些地方，看看沒有源石的那片藍色的天空下，究竟會發生什麼事情。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伯梅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_493_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不必了。那裡的鮮血不比那年秋天的維杜尼亞少，不是嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FUZE",
      "speakerId": "avg_4126_fuze_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "浸入土地的鮮血不應該用多少來計量。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伯梅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_493_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈……舒瑞，你也能說會道起來了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伯梅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_493_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你走吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伯梅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_493_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "法術已經失敗，你再也不可能告訴我那片藍色的天空下是怎樣的景色，我也不可能再在你的講述中身臨其境。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伯梅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_493_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "走吧，趁著我還沒變成源石粉塵之前趕快走，這樣，我一生中的最後的，也是唯一的一件惡行也將無疾而終。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伯梅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_493_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怎麼，突然又有話想跟這個一事無成的人說了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FUZE",
      "speakerId": "avg_4126_fuze_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "世界上的……大地上的……悲劇，或許沒有你想的那麼多。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伯梅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_493_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那我在維杜尼亞見到的是什麼？你在那些你剛剛說的地方經歷的是什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FUZE",
      "speakerId": "avg_4126_fuze_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "混亂。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FUZE",
      "speakerId": "avg_4126_fuze_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "混亂也許會帶來衰頹和死亡，也許不會。混亂有時甚至會成為我的朋友，給我指引一條從中離開的路。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FUZE",
      "speakerId": "avg_4126_fuze_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "混亂並不總是悲劇收場，除非……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伯梅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_493_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "除非我什麼都不做，是嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FUZE",
      "speakerId": "avg_4126_fuze_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伯梅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_493_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "也許吧，舒瑞，但是太晚了……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伯梅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_493_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "太晚了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伯梅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_493_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "舒瑞，你說人死後還會有靈魂嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FUZE",
      "speakerId": "avg_4126_fuze_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我不擅長這種話題。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伯梅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_493_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒關係，我只是在想，假如真的有這種東西，你說我死後……能去你記憶中的撒馬爾罕，看看那裡藍色的穹頂嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FUZE",
      "speakerId": "avg_4126_fuze_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果你想……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FUZE",
      "speakerId": "avg_4126_fuze_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……我不是不可以出於自己的意志告訴你它的模樣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伯梅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_493_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我真的還有資格聽嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FUZE",
      "speakerId": "avg_4126_fuze_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "別真的一事無成。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "憔悴的男人瞪大了眼，然後虛弱地笑了出來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伯梅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_493_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "也許你不愛說話的原因是你太聰明，舒瑞。聰明人總是擅長冒犯別人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "FUZE聳了聳肩，盡可能詳盡地講述起那座廣場，還有廣場附近建築的樣貌。\n而伯梅舉起短杖，一座逼真的雷吉斯坦廣場模型在桌前緩緩成形。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FUZE",
      "speakerId": "avg_4126_fuze_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……像，太像了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伯梅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_493_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……那就好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伯梅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_493_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你接下來要去哪裡？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FUZE",
      "speakerId": "avg_4126_fuze_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "水塔。我還要在鎮上待一小段時間，替你把你本來應做的事情做完。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伯梅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_493_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "去吧，把老維塞帶回去，讓他和他的孫女度過他自己最後這段時光。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FUZE",
      "speakerId": "avg_4126_fuze_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我會的。再見。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伯梅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_493_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……你多保重。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "聽到門鎖的聲響後，伯梅用最後的力氣舉起短杖。\n這次再沒有什麼旋律響起，他只是封住了房間的門窗。\n短杖啪的一聲掉在地上，但伯梅已經聽不見了。他不住地摩挲著建築模型藍色的穹頂，心中想著從未見過的那一抹蔚藍色的天空。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": []
}
